# Panel 260 (provisional, author ratification pending): a group that says
# `layer` and whose header is none of the platform layer's and includes none of
# them binds nothing of the layer, and would make every program reaching it
# compile and link the layer for nothing: refused at the word, told at `build`,
# which follows the header's includes. The fix takes the word out.

extern "layer-a-group-saying-layer-whose-header-reaches-none-of-it.h" layer  #~ ffi_layer_unreached
    function answer() -> i64

function main()
    print(answer())
